  30:/Users/jonathanbrown/Documents/dev/aura/lib/Aurora-SDK/libs/libDaisy//src/util/VoctCalibration.h ****      *  \param val3V ADC reading for 3 volts
  31:/Users/jonathanbrown/Documents/dev/aura/lib/Aurora-SDK/libs/libDaisy//src/util/VoctCalibration.h ****      *  \retval returns true if the calibraiton is successful - this is always true
